message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Supermarket Loyalty: Spend Forecasting and Reward Cost Estimation"
authors:
  - family-names: Yousefi
    given-names: Sahand
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2025-12-31
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sahandyousefi/Supermarket-Loyalty-ML-Project"
keywords:
  - customer analytics
  - loyalty programme
  - conformal prediction
  - heteroscedastic regression
  - causal inference
  - experiment design
  - tabular deep learning
  - Monte Carlo simulation
abstract: >-
  Spend forecasting for supermarket loyalty members with a statistical
  comparison of linear, kernel, tree and deep tabular models, prediction
  intervals calibrated within joining cohorts, a Monte Carlo forecast of
  total reward cost under a tiered reward schedule, an observational
  estimate of the sign-up promotion effect and the design of a randomised
  test, with monitoring, synthetic data and a scoring service.
